      "title": "Definitions and proof vary",
      "text": "A filed monthly-deduction rider illustrates a six-month disability requirement and a definition that changes after an initial period. Other products use their own approved wording. Continued proof, recovery, age limits, exclusions and an in-force rider at onset may matter.",
